WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.266 --> 00:00:01.601 align:start size:94% position:6%
-Thanks to newly developed
technology,

00:00:01.601 --> 00:00:03.069 size:84% position:42%
we here at "Late Night"
now have the ability

00:00:03.069 --> 00:00:07.374
to record the tiny voice that is
inside Donald Trump's head.

00:00:07.374 --> 00:00:08.675 line:92%
And you might be surprised

00:00:08.675 --> 00:00:11.077 align:start size:94% position:6%
to know that,
like everyone's inner voice,

00:00:11.077 --> 00:00:15.849
Donald Trump's is filled with
paralyzing fear and self-doubt.

00:00:15.849 --> 00:00:16.583 size:84% position:42% line:92%
It's easily distracted.

00:00:16.583 --> 00:00:21.921
So here is the tiny voice in
the back of Donald Trump's head.

00:00:21.921 --> 00:00:24.624 align:start size:94% position:6% line:92%
♪♪♪♪

00:00:24.624 --> 00:00:25.458 align:start size:94% position:6% line:92%
[ Applause ]

00:00:25.458 --> 00:00:27.227 align:start size:94% position:6%
-I just want to thank...
-Hey, Donald.

00:00:27.227 --> 00:00:29.496 align:start size:94% position:6%
It's the tiny voice
in the back of your head.

00:00:29.496 --> 00:00:31.097 align:start size:94% position:6%
And it's time for you
to face facts.

00:00:31.097 --> 00:00:33.633 align:start size:94% position:6%
You are way more comfortable
standing with children

00:00:33.633 --> 00:00:35.835 align:start size:94% position:6%
than you are
when you stand with adults.

00:00:35.835 --> 00:00:36.369 align:start size:94% position:6% line:92%
[ Laughter ]

00:00:36.369 --> 00:00:38.104 align:start size:94% position:6%
Because with children,
you fit right in.

00:00:38.104 --> 00:00:42.976
You can have your hands at your
side and swing back and forth

00:00:42.976 --> 00:00:46.579
and get easily distracted
and no one even notices.

00:00:46.579 --> 00:00:49.582 align:start size:94% position:6%
Plus you're so much stronger
than them.

00:00:49.582 --> 00:00:52.685 align:start size:94% position:6%
You could pick up
this kid next to you

00:00:52.685 --> 00:00:54.988 line:92%
and just toss him into the lawn.

00:00:54.988 --> 00:00:56.790 line:92%
Stop his dumb smile there.

00:00:56.790 --> 00:00:57.223 align:start size:94% position:6% line:92%
Yeah.

00:00:57.223 --> 00:00:59.893 align:start size:94% position:6%
I hope you're ready
to get tossed.

00:00:59.893 --> 00:01:00.493 align:start size:94% position:6% line:92%
[ Laughter ]

00:01:00.493 --> 00:01:02.929 align:start size:94% position:6%
Hey, who's that hot lady
over there?

00:01:02.929 --> 00:01:04.464 line:92%
I wonder if she's single.

00:01:04.464 --> 00:01:07.300 size:88% position:44% line:92%
Oh, oh, I recognize her.

00:01:07.300 --> 00:01:08.735 size:78% position:39% line:92%
Oh, you did it again.

00:01:08.735 --> 00:01:11.805 line:92%
You are going straight to hell.

